          "routerPrompt": "Look at the output from the user and try to route it to Bob or Jen depending on the content from the user. ",
          "generatedCode": "function route(input, context, state) {\n  var text = typeof input === \"string\"\n    ? input\n    : input && typeof input === \"object\" && typeof input.text === \"string\"\n      ? input.text\n      : JSON.stringify(input);\n\n  var mentionsBob = /\\bbob\\b/i.test(text || \"\");\n  var mentionsJen = /\\bjen\\b/i.test(text || \"\");\n\n  if (mentionsBob && !mentionsJen) {\n    return { targetIds: [\"257e66ee-cc9b-4ba4-93d1-ffaa9808af38\"], state: state || {} };\n  }\n\n  if (mentionsJen && !mentionsBob) {\n    return { targetIds: [\"4374a43f-d063-40d0-8f9c-74ceb2c6f5da\"], state: state || {} };\n  }\n\n  return {\n    targetIds: [\n      \"257e66ee-cc9b-4ba4-93d1-ffaa9808af38\",\n      \"4374a43f-d063-40d0-8f9c-74ceb2c6f5da\"\n    ],\n    state: state || {}\n  };\n}",
          "generatedSummary": "Routes explicit Bob or Jen requests to that agent. Messages naming both or neither go to both so ambiguous user intent is not discarded.",
          "generatedAt": "2026-07-31T23:22:33.605Z",
          "generatedJobId": "df5538ca-5f17-4aca-8dd7-7e2f4867de1f",
          "generatedAssumptions": [
